export anchor SecurityConsoleStyle:
    number: 378
    screen: SmartHome
    name: Security console
    idea: The home seen as a monitoring desk, a 2 by 2 camera wall with burned in captions leads, an armed status strip runs across the top, and a time stamped event log and zone list carry the rest in dense monospace.
    base: dark
    palette:
        page: #08090b, page, camera wall gutter is pure black
        panel: #111317, panels and swatch cells
        panel2: #171a1f, buttons, mode keys, rows
        line: #262a31, every panel border and row rule
        ink: #e6e8eb, text and peak bars
        mute: #9aa1ab, times, labels, low bars
        armed: #5ee0d0, armed strip, active scene, focus and sheet heads
        onArmed: #04201d, text on armed
        alarm: #ff6b6b, REC, open garage outline, primary button
        alarmBg: #2a1012, alert row in the log
        motion: #ffc857, motion box and tags
        ok: #8be08b, locked tags
    type:
        Monospace for data, ui-monospace, SF Mono, JetBrains Mono, Cascadia
        Mono, Menlo, base 13px at 1.45. The armed word is system-ui 20 to
        22px at 800 with 0.16em tracking. Panel heads system-ui 12px at 700
        caps 0.14em, state tags 12px mono bold caps, the clock 22px at 600.
    layout:
        A near black monitoring desk with 12px gutters. A top strip holds
        the brand with a camera icon, a wide teal armed banner with a
        shield, ARMED and Perimeter, 4 cameras online, 1 alert, and a clock
        box. The main area is a 2 by 2 camera wall on black with 4px gaps.
        Each feed is a simple line drawn scene with a black caption band on
        top naming CAM 01 to 04 and a red REC dot with the word, and a
        bottom band with the state. The front door feed shows LOCKED with a
        lock, the garden feed a dashed yellow motion box around a figure
        with MOTION, the garage feed a 3px red outline, the open door, OPEN
        2H and a red Close now, and the living room three lit lamps with the
        room facts. A 360px side column stacks an Event log of time stamped
        rows with icons, the open garage row on a dark red ground, and a
        Zones table with temperature and state. Below sit a Power panel with
        three figures and a bar strip, and a Scene panel of four joined mode
        keys with Movie filled teal and a square mark. Below 1040px the side
        column drops under the wall, and at phone width feeds stack one per
        row.
    spacing: 4px inside the camera wall, 12px between panels, 8 by 12px rows.
    density: Very high. Four feeds, a log, a zone table, power and modes on one screen.
    corners: Square, with 2px on buttons and fields only.
    borders: 1px #262a31 on every panel and row. Feeds use 2 to 3px inset outlines for motion and alarm.
    shadows: None. Captions sit on 72 to 78 percent black bands.
    icons:
        Line icons at 2px stroke, 16px. A lock for locked, a walking figure
        for motion, a triangle for open, a shield for armed and a film frame
        for the scene.
    focus: A 2px teal outline offset 2px.
    tone: Operator shorthand in caps, such as CAM 03, OPEN 2H, REC and Event log.
